*{{flag|Abkhazia}} — Visa required. Tourists from all countries (except Georgia) can visit Abkhazia for a period not exceeding 24 hours as part of an organized tourist group.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://mfaapsny.org/en/consular-service/visa-free/ | title=Visa-free entry in Abkhazia}}</ref>
*[[File:Flag of the Greek Orthodox Church.svg|21px]] [[Mount Athos]] — Special permit required (4 days: 25 [[EUR]] for [[Eastern Orthodox Church|Orthodox]] visitors, 35 EUR for non-Orthodox visitors, 18 EUR for students). There is a visitors' quota: maximum 100 [[Eastern Orthodox Church|Orthodox]] and 10 non-Orthodox per day and women are not allowed.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.athosfriends.org/PilgrimsGuide/planning/|title=The Friends of Mount Athos - A Pilgrim's Guide to Mount Athos: Planning Your Visit|website=www.athosfriends.org|access-date=17 July 2017|archive-date=1 December 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171201154734/http://athosfriends.org/PilgrimsGuide/planning/|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.mountathosinfos.gr/pages/agionoros/pilgrims_info.en.html|title=MOUNT ATHOS INFO, ΑΓΙΟΝ ΟΡΟΣ, BERG ATHOS, OURANOUPOLIS, ΟΥΡΑΝΟΥΠΟΛΗ|first=DATAFON Verginis G.|last=Ioannis|website=www.mountathosinfos.gr|access-date=2014-12-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20071201150655/http://www.mountathosinfos.gr/pages/agionoros/pilgrims_info.en.html|archive-date=2007-12-01|url-status=dead}}</ref>
*{{flag|Republic of Crimea}} — Visa regime of Russia is applied.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.themoscowtimes.com/news/article/foreigners-now-need-russian-visa-to-visit-crimea/497173.html|title=Foreigners Now Need Russian Visa to Visit Crimea|date=April 2014}}</ref>
*{{flag|Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus}} — unlimited access;. [[Turkish identity card|ID card]] valid<ref>{{cite web|url=https://mfa.gov.ct.tr/consular-info/visa-regulations/|title=VISA Regulations - Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus|date=4 March 2014|access-date=17 July 2017}}</ref>
*{{flagicon|United Nations}} [[United Nations Buffer Zone in Cyprus|UN Buffer Zone in Cyprus]] — Access Permit is required for travelling inside the zone, except Civil Use Areas.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.unficyp.org/nqcontent.cfm?a_id=1608&tt=graphic&lang=l1 |title=UNFICYP > Buffer Zone Permits |access-date=2014-08-01 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141021143210/http://www.unficyp.org/nqcontent.cfm?a_id=1608&tt=graphic&lang=l1 |archive-date=2014-10-21}}</ref>
*{{flag|Faroe Islands}} — Visa required.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.visitfaroeislands.com/en/about-the-faroe-islands/important-facts-for-travelers/passport-and-visa/ |title=Passport and visa |access-date=2014-07-30 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140720043911/http://www.visitfaroeislands.com/en/about-the-faroe-islands/important-facts-for-travelers/passport-and-visa/ |archive-date=2014-07-20 }}</ref>
*{{flag|Gibraltar}} — Visa required.<ref>{{Timatic|nationality=TR|destination=GI}}</ref>
*{{flag|Guernsey}} – Visa required.<ref name="gov.gg">{{cite web |url=http://www.gov.gg/doirequireanentryclearance |title=Do I require an entry clearance/ VISA - Guernsey |access-date=2013-11-26 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131202222421/http://www.gov.gg/doirequireanentryclearance |archive-date=2013-12-02}}</ref>
*{{flagicon|Guernsey}} {{flag|Alderney}} – Visa required.<ref name="gov.gg"/>
*{{flagicon|Guernsey}} {{flag|Sark}} – Visa required.<ref name="gov.gg"/>
*{{flag|Isle of Man}} — Visa required.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.gov.im/categories/home-and-neighbourhood/immigration/foreign-nationals/ |title=Isle of Man Government - Foreign nationals |access-date=2014-07-30 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140629181047/http://www.gov.im/categories/home-and-neighbourhood/immigration/foreign-nationals/ |archive-date=2014-06-29 }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.iomguide.com/immigration.php|title=Isle of Man Guide - GOVERNMENT, Immigration|first=Maxima Systems|last=Ltd.|website=www.iomguide.com|access-date=17 July 2017}}</ref>
*{{flagicon|Norway}} [[Jan Mayen]] — Permit issued by the local police required for staying for less than 24 hours<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.jan-mayen.no/visit.htm|title=JAN MAYEN HOMESITE, EDITED BY THE JAN MAYEN CREW|first=Jan Mayen|last=Crew|website=www.jan-mayen.no|access-date=17 July 2017|archive-date=30 April 2013|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130430074108/http://www.jan-mayen.no/visit.htm|url-status=dead}}</ref> and permit issued by the [[Norwegian Police Service|Norwegian police]] for staying for more than 24 hours.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.lovdata.no/for/sf/jd/xd-19620601-0001.html |title=Forskrifter om utlendingers adgang til Jan Mayen |language=no |trans-title=Regulations on foreigners' access to Jan Mayen |website=lovdata.no |access-date=7 March 2022 |archive-url=https://archive.today/20220307005017/https://lovdata.no/dokument/SF/forskrift/1962-06-01-1 |archive-date=7 March 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref>
*{{flag|Jersey}} – Visa required.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.gov.je/Working/WorkPermits/Pages/NeedWorkPermit.aspx|title=Work permits and working in Jersey|first=States of|last=Jersey|website=www.gov.je|access-date=17 July 2017|archive-date=28 August 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170828191506/https://www.gov.je/Working/WorkPermits/Pages/NeedWorkPermit.aspx|url-status=dead}}</ref>
*{{flag|Kosovo}} — Visa free for 90 days.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.mfa-ks.net/?page=2,158|title=Special Categories Exempted From Visa Requirements - For Foreign Citizens - Consular Services - Ministry of Foreign Affairs - Republic of Kosovo|website=Ministry of Foreign Affairs - Republic of Kosovo}}</ref>
*{{flagicon|Russia}} [[Russian closed city|Closed cities and regions in Russia]] — special authorization required.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_1006.html#entry_requirements |title=Russian Federation Country Specific Information |website=www.travel.state.gov |url-status=dead|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131203003453/http://www.travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_1006.html#entry_requirements |archive-date=2013-12-03}}</ref>
*{{flag|South Ossetia}} — Visa required. To enter South Ossetia, visitors must have a multiple-entry visa for [[Russia]] and register their stay with the Migration Service of the Ministry of Internal Affairs within 3 days.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.mfa-rso.su/taxonomy/term/13 | title=Порядок въезда на территорию Республики Южная Осетия для иностранных граждан}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://mfa.rsogov.org/node/1398 | title=Порядок въезда на территорию Республики Южная Осетия для иностранных граждан}}</ref>
